/T (Other Costs: Be aware of other costs that may arise in setting up and maintaining your short-term let. For example, you may need to engage an accountant to file your tax return. You may also have fees to pay to local or national authorities. In Northern Ireland for example, all tourist accommodation provider must receive Tourism NI certification. In some cases, you may also need to apply for planning permission for change of use of your property. Listed buildings may also need special consent to be held out as short-term lets.)
